    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fc0hy4t",
      "content": "Workshop practices refer to the basic procedures and methods followed in workshops and industrial environments while performing technical work. These practices ensure efficient work, safety, proper tool handling, and maintenance of machines and equipment. In technical trades such as fitter, electrician, mechanic, and welder, following proper workshop practices is essential for maintaining productivity and safety."
    },
